 rebuild stack remains unchanged; separate Medicare #168 stays at 2051a9870d2ede97ab30d72597c4bc2c90b20d53.',\n 'Main already contains merged #140 and #153 at b2923793790975dbf619674ed59c768402e8d7d6. Repository allows merge commits and has no active ruleset or protected-main requirement at readback.',\n 'Local merges resolve 60 main conflicts by preserving approved shared-plugin removals and stable rebuilt toolchain/Effect-native six-journey checks; the one Medicare plan conflict combines the dated scopes. No calculator rule was hand-edited during conflict resolution.',\n 'Published Commonplace development-workflows manifest and matching release both report 0.6.10; this is the loaded installation. The unauthenticated web source returned 404; authenticated primary GitHub reads verified the manifest and release.',\n 'Documentation impact: Change required for current checking architecture, profile, plugin profiles, retired task commands and active plan. Preserve accepted runtime/public content/Changesets, six journey oracles, original historical evidence, Entire settings, PostHog/metrics deferrals and consumer/provider limits. N/A for dependency or new tax/provider design changes.',\n 'The initial focused docs check failed on two references to the retired skill command. The corrected owner passed docs, governance types/tests/runtime. Frozen install, docs/runbooks/format/lint also passed before the complete graph.'\n ],\n 'postconditions':['Every one of the 81 recorded PR heads is an ancestor of the integration candidate. Complete combined-source release checks are not yet claimed.'],\n 'detailArtifacts':[{'path':Path(p).name,'sha256':sha(p)} for p in ['/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-open-prs.json','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-main-before.json','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-plugin-manifest.json','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-commonplace-releases.jsonl','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-preflight-results.jsonl','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-preflight-recovery-results.jsonl','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-qualified-preflight-results.jsonl']],\n 'limitations':['Combined-source release checks must pass before the requested merge. The earlier separate local checks do not prove this new combination.','GitHub and Linear independent readback own the eventual merge outcome; this receipt currently establishes preparation only.','Merging does not complete T008/T009 or full T010 acceptance. Collection remains off.'],\n 'nonClaims':['No hosted CI success, package release/publication, package version application, new Preview/Production deployment, provider or credential mutation is claimed.','The exact adad source exception remains 0d82b82d1c48079fc4b8e2ec96abadfe12999789. No independent adad consumer acceptance or calculation enablement is claimed.'],\n 'rollbackOrRecovery':'Before external merge, discard or revert only this isolated integration branch to the retained handover parent. After merge, prepare a reviewed revert of the actual main merge commit with first-parent selection, preserving the immutable source and receipts. Do not force-push main or change providers.',\n 'observedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat()\n}\np=Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json');p.write_text(json.dumps(record,indent=2)+'\\n')\nprint({'allRecordedHeadsContained':len(prs),'receipt':str(p)})\nPY\n git add tools/governance/policy.ts tools/governance/policy.test.ts turbo.json docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json\n git commit -m 'docs: record merge-all authority and combined source [skip ci]'"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,subprocess,hashlib,datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\nprs=json.loads(Path('/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-open-prs.json').read_text())\nfor p in prs:\n subprocess.run(['git','merge-base','--is-ancestor',p['headRefOid'],'HEAD'],check=True)\nactor=json.loads(Path('/private/tmp/t