{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T04:07:23.199Z","ordinal":77278,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a119a1-b5ae-7cf0-a81d-8528237cff7c","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-944e2f05-784b-4655-bfa7-d71fcdd04509","process_id":"71983","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","cat docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json; rg -n 'Merge|merge-all|601693|892b|12b6|authority' docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"cat docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json","name":"2026-10-08-merge-all.json","path":"docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'Merge|merge-all|601693|892b|12b6|authority' docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md","query":"Merge|merge-all|601693|892b|12b6|authority","path":"clean-slate-foundation.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"{\n  \"schemaVersion\": \"1\",\n  \"status\": \"inconclusive\",\n  \"claim\": \"Qualify the exact combination of all 81 open TaxKit PR heads with the already merged main changes before the authorised repository merge.\",\n  \"target\": \"crcorbett/taxkit main; integration branch codex/merge-all-20261008\",\n  \"candidateIdentity\": \"ae32f42694278566d79cbec673d5c895077fcf4e\",\n  \"actor\": \"Cooper Corbett approves; Codex executes through GitHub account crcorbett\",\n  \"authorityReceipt\": \"Direct human instruction in this chat on 8 October 2026: Merge everything. Approval covers all 81 open TaxKit drafts, ready conversion, conflict resolution, commits/pushes and repository merges for this task. Local checks follow Cooper's earlier direction. No package publication, version application, new deployment, billing, credentials, provider mutation or adad source/enablement change is included.\",\n  \"environment\": \"Local Mac validation; GitHub crcorbett/taxkit repository merge; Personal Taxkit Linear tracking\",\n  \"journeyIds\": [\n    \"taxkit-calculator-direct\",\n    \"taxkit-sdk-packed\",\n    \"taxkit-http-api\",\n    \"taxkit-docs-runtime\",\n    \"taxkit-release-closure\",\n    \"taxkit-native-website\"\n  ],\n  \"observations\": [\n    \"Fresh open inventory: 81 drafts. The 80-head reviewed rebuild stack remains unchanged; separate Medicare #168 stays at 2051a9870d2ede97ab30d72597c4bc2c90b20d53.\",\n    \"Main already contains merged #140 and #153 at b2923793790975dbf619674ed59c768402e8d7d6. Repository allows merge commits and has no active ruleset or protected-main requirement at readback.\",\n    \"Local merges resolve 60 main conflicts by preserving approved shared-plugin removals and stable rebuilt toolchain/Effect-native six-journey checks; the one Medicare plan conflict combines the dated scopes. No calculator rule was hand-edited during conflict resolution.\",\n    \"Published Commonplace development-workflows manifest and matching release both report 0.6.10; this is the loaded installation. The unauthenticated web source returned 404; authenticated primary GitHub reads verified the manifest and release.\",\n    \"Documentation impact: Change required for current checking architecture, profile, plugin profiles, retired task commands and active plan. Preserve accepted runtime/public content/Changesets, six journey oracles, original historical evidence, Entire settings, PostHog/metrics deferrals and consumer/provider limits. N/A for dependency or new tax/provider design changes.\",\n    \"The initial focused docs check failed on two references to the retired skill command. The corrected owner passed docs, governance types/tests/runtime. Frozen install, docs/runbooks/format/lint also passed before the complete graph.\",\n    \"The first complete combined-source report at 12b6d7d765dc7c645e1034b967b1c33fd605528e stopped at verification in 7.31 seconds: the historical receipt checker still referenced the removed sha256 helper. Its existing runGit returns bytes; the resolved call uses the existing typed hashEpochBytes operation. The focused epoch type check now passes. No calculator source changed.\",\n    \"The second report at 8cb46fca8f06e1c24fdd6b93293aabe70d35395a stopped at verification in 29.96 seconds. Two historical CLI cases still expected failure messages from before #140. The actual old checkers correctly refuse current source: the removed shared-skill input and changed historical source-artifact identity. Only those two expected diagnostics changed; nonzero refusal, bounded output, safe paths, recovery and invalid-option assertions remain. The full historical suite and Knip pass.\"\n  ],\n  \"postconditions\": [\n    \"Every one of the 81 recorded PR heads is an ancestor of the integration candidate. Complete combined-source release checks are not yet claimed.\"\n  ],\n  \"detailArtifacts\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-open-prs.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"5fbbc370b8b556ce862017a2249e54add5b8743b0828694da8f28fd0272ebca7\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-main-before.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"c41d79690615f8ec198fcf6b35456e76cde305d868695a53a549de196dc2d612\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-plugin-manifest.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"911a5b3d432208bf67a19338b8682dd213be9f76edf70abee7052e24e0c81fbc\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-commonplace-releases.jsonl\",\n      \"sha256\": \"ded0bf7631d30f11195b97662d290e57fe974021d8f39dab75f97875ca440bc5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-preflight-results.jsonl\",\n      \"sha256\": \"8e1d90f2820000e31a0b985359270ad7ae75c2a6a3408cc251be17bb3e937a12\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-preflight-recovery-results.jsonl\",\n      \"sha256\": \"157946ab35dc6c5179d21cf511dc8d0d42fe72bb06f86a91b75a880f3c40d065\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-qualified-prefl