ile, plugin profiles, retired task commands and active plan. Preserve accepted runtime/public content/Changesets, six journey oracles, original historical evidence, Entire settings, PostHog/metrics deferrals and consumer/provider limits. N/A for dependency or new tax/provider design changes.\",\n    \"The initial focused docs check failed on two references to the retired skill command. The corrected owner passed docs, governance types/tests/runtime. Frozen install, docs/runbooks/format/lint also passed before the complete graph.\",\n    \"The first complete combined-source report at 12b6d7d765dc7c645e1034b967b1c33fd605528e stopped at verification in 7.31 seconds: the historical receipt checker still referenced the removed sha256 helper. Its existing runGit returns bytes; the resolved call uses the existing typed hashEpochBytes operation. The focused epoch type check now passes. No calculator source changed.\",\n    \"The second report at 8cb46fca8f06e1c24fdd6b93293aabe70d35395a stopped at verification in 29.96 seconds. Two historical CLI cases still expected failure messages from before #140. The actual old checkers correctly refuse current source: the removed shared-skill input and changed historical source-artifact identity. Only those two expected diagnostics changed; nonzero refusal, bounded output, safe paths, recovery and invalid-option assertions remain. The full historical suite and Knip pass.\"\n  ],\n  \"postconditions\": [\n    \"Every one of the 81 recorded PR heads is an ancestor of the integration candidate. Complete combined-source release checks are not yet claimed.\"\n  ],\n  \"detailArtifacts\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-open-prs.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"5fbbc370b8b556ce862017a2249e54add5b8743b0828694da8f28fd0272ebca7\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-main-before.json\",\n      \"sha256\": \"c41d79690615f8ec198fcf6b35456e76cde305d868695a53a549de196dc2d612\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"taxkit-merge-plugin-mani