/docs-deployment/workflow-evidence.test.ts (11 tests) 634ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/local-doppler.test.ts (2 tests) 190ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/alchemy-memo.test.ts (1 test) 59ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/strict-boundaries.contract.test.ts (40 tests) 146ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/workflow-plan-projection.test.ts (31 tests) 51ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/retired-source.boundary.test.ts (4 tests) 46ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/workflow-artifact.test.ts (11 tests) 39ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/inventory-credentials.boundary.test.ts (10 tests) 26ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/policy.test.ts (20 tests) 37ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/doppler-custody.test.ts (9 tests) 32ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/automation.check.runtime.test.ts (5 tests) 31ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task: \n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":13333},"formatted_output":"$ bun run --filter=@taxkit/scripts release:check --ci\n@taxkit/scripts release:check: RUN  [verification] bun run verification\n\ntmp/release-readiness/verification-stdout-GulsJD/70e0c6de34f6.log thout credentials or provider state 424ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:    ✓ the actual native plan command checks dirty without credentials or provider state 380ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/retirement.refusal.boundary.test.ts (17 tests) 1012ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:    ✓ the actual old Alchemy entry refuses before state or provider services 602ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/workflow-evidence.test.ts (11 tests) 634ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/local-doppler.test.ts (2 tests) 190ms\n//:test:docs-deployment:task:  ✓ tools/docs-deployment/alche