{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T04:10:26.850Z","ordinal":77385,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a119a1-b5ae-7cf0-a81d-8528237cff7c","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-dd14f733-9dbf-48c2-8217-15047e264641","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.get_status_updates","arguments":{"type":"project","project":"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069","limit":10,"orderBy":"updatedAt"},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"get_status_updates","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"statusUpdates\":[{\"id\":\"7698bed9-d230-496c-8574-71b68dd2da5a\",\"body\":\"The maintainer review and handover is ready in [draft #170](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/170). Two misleading documentation claims are corrected. All nine release checks passed on this Mac, including fresh SDK package/downstream checks and both built website/API runs with all 22 cases. [Exact source and evidence](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/fc4da30fdc6797ebed905c79823ff5e9508d33ba/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-review-handover.json).\\n\\nCooper postponed PostHog and metrics. Collection stays off, and DEV-79/DEV-80 retain their unfinished work. DEV-81's full rebuild acceptance remains open. The separately approved Medicare correction stays in [draft #168](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/168); this handover changes no calculator results. Existing deployments remain governed by their earlier receipts.\\n\\nNo merge, package version application, publication, new deployment, billing, credential or provider change was made. Hosted checks are skipped under Cooper's instruction while Actions credits are exhausted; the evidence is local. The next wider rebuild work needs Cooper's direction to resume the postponed requirements.\",\"health\":\"onTrack\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-7698bed9\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-08T02:05:49.185Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-08T02:05:49.185Z\",\"editedAt\":null,\"archivedAt\":null,\"diffMarkdown\":\"\",\"isDiffHidden\":false,\"user\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"type\":\"project\",\"project\":{\"id\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\"}},{\"id\":\"76b26aa5-e11c-41dd-8aec-d5bd0812347d\",\"body\":\"Maintainers now have checked instructions for running TaxKit deployments from this Mac. They cover the existing credentials and shared state, full provider reads, exact plan review and recovery steps. No action is required from calculator users.\\n\\n[Draft #163](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163) is ready for Cooper review, and [DEV-78](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78) is In Review. Complete local verification passed, including the freshly built Website/API tests. The [handover receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json) records the exact source, failed attempts, passing checks and limits. This documentation update made no new provider, credential or deployment change. Cloud rollback and an empty repeat plan remain separate unproved outcomes.\\n\\nThe [live agent guide](https://taxkit.dev/api/agent-tools) and both deployments retain the earlier #162 evidence. Next is the agreed minimal page/calculator-name analytics. Read-only preparation found no TaxKit PostHog project or PostHog setting in TaxKit’s secret store, so project setup will have a separate concrete approval step. Ordinary Preview and local capture stay off. Metrics remain deferred, including the separately observed Cloudflare browser beacon. Retained tax results remain unchanged while the Medicare decision is outstanding; final rebuild acceptance remains incomplete.\",\"health\":\"onTrack\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-76b26aa5\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:08:04.749Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:08:04.749Z\",\"editedAt\":null,\"archivedAt\":null,\"diffMarkdown\":\"\",\"isDiffHidden\":false,\"user\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"type\":\"project\",\"project\":{\"id\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\"}},{\"id\":\"6daf1f68-5c0e-4c8e-aedb-cdc6bd5cfcd4\",\"body\":\"You can now use TaxKit’s [agent connection guide](https://taxkit.dev/api/agent-tools) to connect a supporting AI app. Each [agents page](https://taxkit.dev/agents) shows its own server address. The guide explains all remote and visible browser tools, request limits and experimental browser support.\\n\\n[Draft #162](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/162) is ready for review. The full local checks passed, and both Preview and Production deployed from this Mac under Cooper’s authority. Live checks pass the guide, Markdown, search, mobile use, all three retained calculator answers and both supported official AI clients. Production domain ownership, DNS settings, redirect and records remain unchanged. [Source, checks, authority and delivery evidence](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/778c6b2052c5bc065355146245e697cf52b14374/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-agent-setup-and-cancellation-bounds.json).\\n\\n[DEV-77](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-77/csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools) is In Review. Its written contract preserves the tested modern cancellation limit: closing a call stops the client while server work may continue for up to five seconds. Test-controlled native browser calls are proved; autonomous AI sessions and general browser availability remain unqualified. No merge or package publication occurred.\\n\\nNext are the deployment instructions and remaining accepted analytics work. The metrics approach stays deferred, including the separately observed Cloudflare browser beacon. Worker logs/traces remain disabled. Retained tax results are unchanged while the Medicare decision is outstanding. Final clean-slate acceptance remains incomplete.\",\"health\":\"onTrack\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-6daf1f68\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T09:31:59.585Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T09:31:59.585Z\",\"editedAt\":null,\"archivedAt\":null,\"diffMarkdown\":\"*Progress since Oct 7*: 10% → 13%\",\"isDiffHidden\":false,\"user\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"type\":\"project\",\"project\":{\"id\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\"}},{\"id\":\"560420b2-94e8-4784-854b-7b744b456e73\",\"body\":\"TaxKit's rebuilt Website and API are now live at [taxkit.dev](https://taxkit.dev) and [api.taxkit.dev](https://api.taxkit.dev), with a separate [Preview Website](https://taxkitappscloudflare-taxkitweb7xvou7miucr7nekqlt7s3lct.coopercorbett.workers.dev). Both environments pass live calculator answers, documentation and search, mobile layout, calculation without JavaScript and ordinary official AI-client calls. Production's www redirect preserves path and query. No action is required to try these pages; agent setup documentation is still unfinished.\\n\\n[Draft #161](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/161) retains the exact source, plans, deployment and readback evidence. App source `787e6f72a4a2e06605290eaeb1990a360776a387` passed all nine local checks in 1,038.5 seconds. All 1,744 recorded tracked identities and eighteen output digests matched; both fourteen-case built-app runs passed. Documentation closeout `580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2` leaves that app code unchanged and passes focused documentation/runbook/path checks. [Authority, proof and recovery receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-cloud-preparation.json).\\n\\nCooper directed checks and deployments to run from this Mac while GitHub credits are unavailable and authorised Preview and Production. The existing Production token received only the separately approved three taxkit.dev permissions; its identity, value, expiry and earlier grants were preserved. Preview deployed at 07:54 UTC and Production at 08:03 UTC on 7 October. Independent Cloudflare reads prove the app connections, saved versions, separate rate limits, hostname ownership and unchanged DNS settings. The existing shared store stayed at version seven; no bootstrap or upgrade, old-resource removal, merge or package publication occurred.\\n\\nEarlier [draft #158](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/158) proves bounded older remote-session lifetimes and cleanup, and its [exact-commit hosted Quality check](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37574967845) passed at 05:29 UTC. Drafts #156 and #157 also passed their exact-commit hosted checks. [Draft #160](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/160) supplies checked source identities for native plans. Parent #159 exceeded its thirty-minute hosted limit; that run did not complete. The limit is now sixty minutes with all checks retained. These historical checks are separate from the latest local and live deployment proof.\\n\\nModern-client cancellation still stops its caller while backend work remains until its five-second limit; that behaviour and public setup remain unfinished in [DEV-77](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-77/csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools). [DEV-78](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans) remains In Progress for current workflow/evidence alignment. A later Preview plan still proposes updates for unresolved peer Outputs, so no no-op convergence is claimed.\\n\\nThe metrics approach remains deferred. Worker logging/tracing is explicitly disabled, but the Production browser shows a separate Cloudflare-injected `/cdn-cgi/rum` beacon. Its configuration owner and privacy have not been qualified; no beacon or metrics configuration was changed. Retained tax results remain unchanged while the separate Medicare decision is outstanding. Final clean-slate acceptance remains incomplete.\",\"health\":\"onTrack\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-560420b2\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T03:09:48.289Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T08:15:30.696Z\",\"editedAt\":\"2026-10-07T08:15:30.656Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"diffMarkdown\":\"*Progress since Oct 4*: 5% → 10%\",\"isDiffHidden\":false,\"user\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"type\":\"project\",\"project\":{\"id\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\"}},{\"id\":\"aadf16cc-8234-46bd-8ab1-f317f7f756b5\",\"body\":\"Latest TaxKit clean-slate milestone: [draft #120](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/120), revision `c4d497c2d23262a82c59fd146338e049eafb1259`. All ten deliberate Quality faults have separate test results/deadlines and source copies; fresh-source docs is a separate check. All 30 cases and full verification pass locally (257.01 seconds), with four lint mutations at 44–45 seconds each. Mutation bytes, command failures and exact oracles remain. Package/browser unchanged-input results use matching caches.\\n\\nThis corrects the aggregate five-minute test timeout observed separately in hosted #118 and #119. Later hosted qualification remains pending, and earlier failures are retained in the receipt. Continuing docs app hosts/browser tests, proof scripts, web/infrastructure and semantic/readonly review. DEV-73 stays In Progress; DEV-74–81 follow dependencies, DEV-72 awaits Cooper review. Medicare decision remains separate and pending, with retained results preserved. No merge, deployment, publication, provider apply or version application.\",\"health\":\"atRisk\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-aadf16cc\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T05:47:29.381Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T12:20:09.075Z\",\"editedAt\":\"2026-10-04T12:20:09.006Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"diffMarkdown\":\"\",\"isDiffHidden\":false,\"user\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"type\":\"project\",\"project\":{\"id\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\"}},{\"id\":\"2843a900-9c5f-40be-89c7-da66d4447c27\",\"body\":\"TaxKit’s retained calculators and documentation pass checks on stable Effect 4. Draft PRs #88–98 have passed hosted Quality. The latest docs slice validates public examples, preserves calculator results and checks the built docs in local workerd/Chromium. [Draft PR #99](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/99) adds checked Effect-based skill-policy tests and the [local continuation prompt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/4fb6bc685c90c7442787fcf24a7d694b49038132/docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-local-handoff.md); all required local checks passed, while its new hosted check remains to be read back. Nothing has merged, deployed or been published.\\n\\nCooper requested a handoff to a local thread. Work is committed and pushed on `codex/dev-73-skill-test-boundaries`, and cloud execution pauses here. Wider strict enforcement in DEV-73 and the accepted DEV-74–81 improvements remain unfinished. The continuation prompt records the complete goal, dependency order and review stack.\\n\\nA separate Medicare correction still needs Cooper’s scope decision. [DEV-73](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-73) records the enacted source, effective years and tested impact. Retained results are unchanged; stable-v4 compatibility is not current-law Medicare qualification. This decision blocks its correction only, and independent implementation can resume locally.\",\"health\":\"atRisk\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-2843a900\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T01:54:30.332Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T05:01:37.133Z\",\"editedAt\":\"2026-10-04T05:01:37.081Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"diffMarkdown\":\"\",\"isDiffHidden\":false,\"user\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"type\":\"project\",\"project\":{\"id\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\"}},{\"id\":\"bb9f1260-bde2-40e3-a513-aa9b9c06142e\",\"body\":\"Implementation has started under Cooper's current request. The retained rules and all three 2025–26 calculators have passing baseline tests, and the rebuild now has a source-bound retention and recovery record in [draft PR #88](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/88).\\n\\nThe earlier local offline-install problem does not reproduce in the named cloud environment: the complete quality-workflow tests and repository verification pass. Failed installs now expose their diagnostic output. The completed hosted recovery remains separate historical evidence.\\n\\n[DEV-72](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-72) is awaiting review. [DEV-73](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-73) is qualifying current packages in a scratch fixture. It found the expected TypeScript 7 compiler-integration change and the known React/Atom peer conflict; neither has been silently bypassed in the repository. The new website and API are not yet implemented or available. Merge and deployment remain separately authorised.\",\"health\":\"onTrack\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-bb9f1260\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T01:20:58.153Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T01:20:58.153Z\",\"editedAt\":null,\"archivedAt\":null,\"diffMarkdown\":\"*Progress since Oct 4*: 0% → 5%\",\"isDiffHidden\":false,\"user\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"type\":\"project\",\"project\":{\"id\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\"}},{\"id\":\"8308c396-9298-4e31-9339-ef2a5f3d6c4f\",\"body\":\"The TaxKit rebuild plan is now committed and tracked. The planned first release keeps the docs and all three existing calculators, with a calculator-first website, a Calculate button and expandable explanations. It also includes agent tools, public Markdown and share images, domain/secrets setup, traffic and calculator-use analytics, and safe operational logs.\\n\\nTen implementation issues are queued in Backlog, with 18 prerequisite links matching the source task plan. Each issue records the intended result, checks and committed source links.\\n\\nThe [planning commit](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b) is pushed to main. Documentation and task-file checks passed. Full verification still stops at the existing offline dependency-install test; [the first task](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-72/csf-t001-record-the-starting-point-and-protect-retained-taxkit-work) records that follow-up.\\n\\nImplementation has not started. The next step is final design confirmation and recording the retained code, content and recovery baseline, followed by [package/rule checks](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-73/csf-t002-update-packages-and-enforce-strict-functional-effect-code) and [the first website/backend calculation](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-74/csf-t003-make-one-calculator-work-through-the-separate-website-and). [Final delivery](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-81/csf-t010-finish-rebuild-checks-package-versioning-and-controlled) remains open until its required checks and separately approved deployment steps are proved.\\n\\n[Full design](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md) · [Ordered tasks](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json)\",\"health\":\"onTrack\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-8308c396\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:17:13.374Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:17:13.374Z\",\"editedAt\":null,\"archivedAt\":null,\"diffMarkdown\":\"**Status**: Backlog\",\"isDiffHidden\":false,\"user\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"type\":\"project\",\"project\":{\"id\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\"}}],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":297136250}},"started_at_ms":1791432625552,"completed_at_ms":1791432626850}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T04:10:27.385Z","ordinal":77386,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a119a1-b5ae-7cf0-a81d-8528237cff7c","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-9fd704fc-62e9-4302-9125-0a8b63f9d506","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.list_comments","arguments":{"issueId":"DEV-81","limit":50},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"list_comments","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"142da599-2f9e-4ced-8287-6a971a297bd0\",\"body\":\"The current review and handover is delivered in [draft #170](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/170), commit `fc4da30fdc6797ebed905c79823ff5e9508d33ba`. Both material documentation findings are resolved, and all nine local release checks passed, including fresh packed/downstream SDK execution and both 22-case built website/API runs. [Source, checks and exact limits](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/fc4da30fdc6797ebed905c79823ff5e9508d33ba/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-review-handover.json).\\n\\nThe SPEC, task list, active plan and DEV-79/DEV-80 now record Cooper's PostHog and metrics postponements. Collection stays off. The approved Medicare correction remains separately owned by [#168](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/168); tax values are unchanged here. Full T010/rebuild acceptance remains open with its existing blockers. No merge, version application, publication, deployment, billing, credential or provider operation is part of this handover. Local checks follow Cooper's instruction while Actions credits are exhausted.\\n\\nFinal delivery readback: draft #170 now has head `601693dc93a45b8345db19349f959b2a41508a24`. The follow-up changes only the plan and receipt to record the initial pushed draft and verified Linear updates. All six focused final metadata checks pass; all 1,789 other frozen files remain unchanged. [Final saved handover record](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/601693dc93a45b8345db19349f959b2a41508a24/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-review-handover.json). The complete release report remains source-bound to the reviewed semantic handover; no new full rebuild acceptance or deployment is claimed.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-08T02:05:37.700Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-08T02:09:17.480Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"5026346c-9d82-418d-9dc2-3f24c3f8a665\",\"body\":\"The current task notes now match Cooper's approved work: local Preview/Production deployment is already allowed after its required checks, and the configured release group has ten packages. The old whole-design approval hold is superseded. These corrections are pushed in draft [#167](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/167), commit `da94a2f736b07210bf27b8b467f5d74304d35456`.\\n\\nFresh full local verification passed, including all 34 release-safety cases and all 22 built-app cases. [The saved record](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/da94a2f736b07210bf27b8b467f5d74304d35456/docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md#continuation-owner-reconciliation) retains exact checks, file identities and limits. This correction changes planning documents only; the tested apps stay deployed with event collection off.\\n\\nDEV-81 remains incomplete. Final closeout still needs the two pending analytics decisions, real PostHog setup/event checks, a fresh independent final review and resolution of the deferred metrics work. Task statuses, required checks and native dependency links are preserved.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T16:13:40.160Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T16:13:40.053Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":873998708}},"started_at_ms":1791432625510,"completed_at_ms":1791432627385}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T04:10:27.483Z","ordinal":77387,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a119b4-951b-7423-b20e-6a720d3ceeb5","call_id":"call_041ba2aaa0014fd9a344cdc039d73906","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":0,\"text\":\"{\\\"comments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"142da599-2f9e-4ced-8287-6a971a297bd0\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"The current review and handover is delivered in [draft #170](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/170), commit `fc4da30fdc6797ebed905c79823ff5e9508d33ba`. Both material documentation findings are resolved, and all nine local release checks passed, including fresh packed/downstream SDK execution and both 22-case built website/API runs. [Source, checks and exact limits](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/fc4da30fdc6797ebed905c79823ff5e9508d33ba/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-review-handover.json).\\\\n\\\\nThe SPEC, task list, active plan and DEV-79/DEV-80 now record Cooper's PostHog and metrics postponements. Collection stays off. The approved Medicare correction remains separately owned by [#168](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/168); tax values are unchanged here. Full T010/rebuild acceptance remains open with its existing blockers. No merge, version application, publication, deployment, billing, credential or provider operation is part of this handover. Local checks follow Cooper's instruction while Actions credits are exhausted.\\\\n\\\\nFinal delivery readback: draft #170 now has head `601693dc93a45b8345db19349f959b2a41508a24`. The follow-up changes only the plan and receipt to record the initial pushed draft and verified Linear updates. All six focused final metadata checks pass; all 1,789 other frozen files remain unchanged. [Final saved handover record](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/601693dc93a45b8345db19349f959b2a41508a24/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-review-handover.json). The complete release report remains source-bound to the reviewed semantic handover; no new full rebuild acceptance or deployment is claimed.\\\",\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-08T02:05:37.700Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-08T02:09:17.480Z\\\",\\\"parentId\\\":null,\\\"resolvedAt\\\":null,\\\"quotedText\\\":null,\\\"author\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"onBehalfOf\\\":null},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"5026346c-9d82-418d-9dc2-3f24c3f8a665\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"The current task notes now match Cooper's approved work: local Preview/Production deployment is already allowed after its required checks, and the configured release group has ten packages. The old whole-design approval hold is superseded. These corrections are pushed in draft [#167](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/167), commit `da94a2f736b07210bf27b8b467f5d74304d35456`.\\\\n\\\\nFresh full local verification passed, including all 34 release-safety cases and all 22 built-app cases. [The saved record](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/da94a2f736b07210bf27b8b467f5d74304d35456/docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md#continuation-owner-reconciliation) retains exact checks, file identities and limits. This correction changes planning documents only; the tested apps stay deployed with event collection off.\\\\n\\\\nDEV-81 remains incomplete. Final closeout still needs the two pending analytics decisions, real PostHog setup/event checks, a fresh independent final review and resolution of the deferred metrics work. Task statuses, required checks and native dependency links are preserved.\\\",\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T16:13:40.160Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T16:13:40.053Z\\\",\\\"parentId\\\":null,\\\"resolvedAt\\\":null,\\\"quotedText\\\":null,\\\"author\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"onBehalfOf\\\":null}],\\\"hasNextPage\\\":false}\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":1,\"text\":\"{\\\"statusUpdates\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"7698bed9-d230-496c-8574-71b68dd2da5a\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"The maintainer review and handover is ready in [draft #170](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/170). Two misleading documentation claims are corrected. All nine release checks passed on this Mac, including fresh SDK package/downstream checks and both built website/API runs with all 22 cases. [Exact source and evidence](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/fc4da30fdc6797ebed905c79823ff5e9508d33ba/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-review-handover.json).\\\\n\\\\nCooper postponed PostHog and metrics. Collection stays off, and DEV-79/DEV-80 retain their unfinished work. DEV-81's full rebuild acceptance remains open. The separately approved Medicare correction stays in [draft #168](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/168); this handover changes no calculator results. Existing deployments remain governed by their earlier receipts.\\\\n\\\\nNo merge, package version application, publication, new deployment, billing, credential or provider change was made. Hosted checks are skipped under Cooper's instruction while Actions credits are exhausted; the evidence is local. The next wider rebuild work needs Cooper's direction to resume the postponed requirements.\\\",\\\"health\\\":\\\"onTrack\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-7698bed9\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-08T02:05:49.185Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-08T02:05:49.185Z\\\",\\\"editedAt\\\":null,\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"diffMarkdown\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"isDiffHidden\\\":false,\\\"user\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"project\\\",\\\"project\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"76b26aa5-e11c-41dd-8aec-d5bd0812347d\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Maintainers now have checked instructions for running TaxKit deployments from this Mac. They cover the existing credentials and shared state, full provider reads, exact plan review and recovery steps. No action is required from calculator users.\\\\n\\\\n[Draft #163](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163) is ready for Cooper review, and [DEV-78](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78) is In Review. Complete local verification passed, including the freshly built Website/API tests. The [handover receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json) records the exact source, failed attempts, passing checks and limits. This documentation update made no new provider, credential or deployment change. Cloud rollback and an empty repeat plan remain separate unproved outcomes.\\\\n\\\\nThe [live agent guide](https://taxkit.dev/api/agent-tools) and both deployments retain the earlier #162 evidence. Next is the agreed minimal page/calculator-name analytics. Read-only preparation found no TaxKit PostHog project or PostHog setting in TaxKit’s secret store, so project setup will have a separate concrete approval step. Ordinary Preview and local capture stay off. Metrics remain deferred, including the separately observed Cloudflare browser beacon. Retained tax results remain unchanged while the Medicare decision is outstanding; final rebuild acceptance remains incomplete.\\\",\\\"health\\\":\\\"onTrack\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-76b26aa5\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:08:04.749Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:08:04.749Z\\\",\\\"editedAt\\\":null,\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"diffMarkdown\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"isDiffHidden\\\":false,\\\"user\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"project\\\",\\\"project\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6daf1f68-5c0e-4c8e-aedb-cdc6bd5cfcd4\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"You can now use TaxKit’s [agent connection guide](https://taxkit.dev/api/agent-tools) to connect a supporting AI app. Each [agents page](https://taxkit.dev/agents) shows its own server address. The guide explains all remote and visible browser tools, request limits and experimental browser support.\\\\n\\\\n[Draft #162](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/162) is ready for review. The full local checks passed, and both Preview and Production deployed from this Mac under Cooper’s authority. Live checks pass the guide, Markdown, search, mobile use, all three retained calculator answers and both supported official AI clients. Production domain ownership, DNS settings, redirect and records remain unchanged. [Source, checks, authority and delivery evidence](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/778c6b2052c5bc065355146245e697cf52b14374/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-agent-setup-and-cancellation-bounds.json).\\\\n\\\\n[DEV-77](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-77/csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools) is In Review. Its written contract preserves the tested modern cancellation limit: closing a call stops the client while server work may continue for up to five seconds. Test-controlled native browser calls are proved; autonomous AI sessions and general browser availability remain unqualified. No merge or package publication occurred.\\\\n\\\\nNext are the deployment instructions and remaining accepted analytics work. The metrics approach stays deferred, including the separately observed Cloudflare browser beacon. Worker logs/traces remain disabled. Retained tax results are unchanged while the Medicare decision is outstanding. Final clean-slate acceptance remains incomplete.\\\",\\\"health\\\":\\\"onTrack\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-6daf1f68\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T09:31:59.585Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T09:31:59.585Z\\\",\\\"editedAt\\\":null,\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"diffMarkdown\\\":\\\"*Progress since Oct 7*: 10% → 13%\\\",\\\"isDiffHidden\\\":false,\\\"user\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Cooper Corbett\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"project\\\",\\\"project\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Taxkit\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"560420b2-94e8-4784-854b-7b744b456e73\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"TaxKit's rebuilt Website and API are now live at [taxkit.dev](https://taxkit.dev) and [api.taxkit.dev](https://api.taxkit.dev), with a separate [Preview Website](https://taxkitappscloudflare-taxkitweb7xvou7miucr7nekqlt7s3lct.coopercorbett.workers.dev). Both environments pass live calculator answers, documentation and search, mobile layout, calculation without JavaScript and ordinary official AI-client calls. Production's www redirect preserves path and query. No action is required to try these pages; agent setup documentation is still unfinished.\\\\n\\\\n[Draft #161](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/161) retains the exact source, plans, deployment and readback evidence. App source `787e6f72a4a2e06605290eaeb1990a360776a387` passed all nine local checks in 1,038.5 seconds. All 1,744 recorded tracked identities and eighteen output digests matched; both fourteen-case built-app runs passed. Documentation closeout `580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2` leaves that app code unchanged and passes focused documentation/runbook/path checks. [Authority, proof and recovery receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-cloud-preparation.json).\\\\n\\\\nCooper directed checks and deployments to run from this Mac while GitHub credits are unavailable and authorised Preview and Production. The existing Production token received only the \"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a119a1-b5ae-7cf0-a81d-8528237cff7c","create_time":1791432627.483906}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
