{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T04:11:12.268Z","ordinal":77393,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac717d8f26487d0aded97657f8d28c6","status":"completed","call_id":"call_598898bf8da9419582be01bb73ffd195","name":"exec","input":"store(\"merge-pr-body-template\",`This combines all 81 open TaxKit PRs into main: the reviewed rebuild and the separately approved 2025–26 Medicare correction. It preserves the plugin migration (#140), Entire settings (#153), original reviewed commits, the stable toolchain and all six current journey checks. Conflict fixes remove retired copied-skill checks and retain the historical checkers' refusal of changed source.\n\nValidation: the full nine-part release check ran locally on Cooper's Mac, under the instruction to avoid GitHub Actions while credits are exhausted. The saved merge record binds the exact combined source, check results, failed attempts, recovery and limits. [Merge qualification record](docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json).\n\nPostHog and metrics stay postponed, collection stays off, and full rebuild acceptance remains open. This repository merge applies no package versions, publishes no packages and makes no new deployment, credential, billing, provider or adad change. Recovery is a reviewed revert of the resulting main merge commit to its first parent.\n\nAuthority: Cooper's direct instruction on 8 October 2026: “Merge everything”. Merge commits preserve the reviewed identities; \\`[skip ci]\\` follows Cooper's instruction to run checks locally.`);\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path('tmp/release-readiness/verification-stdout-GulsJD/70e0c6de34f6.log')\\nprint(p.read_text()[-1700:])\\nPY\",\"max_output_tokens\":1700}));\ntext(await tools.clock__curr_time({}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a119a1-b5ae-7cf0-a81d-8528237cff7c","create_time":1791432664.9502463}}}
