{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T07:47:28.119Z","ordinal":77818,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac74a6f3d2c87d0abc359edb33c1dce","status":"completed","call_id":"call_8aa8673e85f64bf7a5c32a838225563b","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport json\\np=Path('docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md');s=p.read_text();old='Skill-policy fixture reads use Effect FileSystem and exact Schema-owned JSON\\\\ningress. Bounded Effect traversal owns repeated I/O; pure classification uses\\\\npersistent collections. `check:skills:types` checks this suite during root\\\\nverification. A readLink assertion proves the actual canonical symlink target.\\\\n';new='The copied shared-skill fixture suite and its commands were removed by #140.\\\\nCurrent shared guidance is resolved through [the plugin lookup](../skills.md)\\\\nand repository profiles. The code-rule suite checks every retained source host\\\\nthrough the real lint command; no fixture or ingress permission remains for the\\\\nremoved `tools/skills` folder. Historical skill receipts retain their original\\\\nsource identities and do not qualify the current checkout.\\\\n';assert s.count(old)==1;p.write_text(s.replace(old,new))\\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');r=json.loads(p.read_text());s=json.dumps(r,indent=2)\\ns=s.replace('\\\"tools/skills/**\\\",','\\\"docs/skills.md\\\",\\\\n        \\\"docs/skill-profiles/**\\\",')\\ns=s.replace('Adopt the complete canonical current repository skills (0.6.1 successor of the designed 0.6.0 baseline) and declared TaxKit profiles/receipts, including the required Linear skill folder and Claude link without creating provider projects/issues.','Resolve the latest published Commonplace development-workflows plugin through docs/skills.md and read the TaxKit profiles alongside it. Preserve repository-specific skills, including the Linear folder and Claude link, without creating provider projects/issues. Historical copied-skill receipts retain their original identities and do not choose the current plugin version.')\\ns=s.replace('tools/oxlint/** policy/fixtures, tools/effect-language-service/** and tools/skills/canonical-skill-baseline.json','tools/oxlint/** policy/fixtures, tools/effect-language-service/**, docs/skills.md and docs/skill-profiles/**')\\ns=s.replace('Canonical .agents/skills/** copies with explicit local profiles; AGENTS.md, README.md and affected package READMEs','Latest published shared-plugin lookup and explicit local profiles; retained repository-specific .agents/skills/**, AGENTS.md, README.md and affected package READMEs')\\np.write_text(s+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md');s=p.read_text()\\ns=s.replace('owns that correction and its qualification. This handover branch keeps its\\\\nexisting results and does not integrate or accept the separate correction.','owns that correction and its qualification. The dated handover did not include\\\\nthat separate correction. Cooper\\\\'s later 8 October \\\"Merge everything\\\" instruction\\\\nauthorises including #168 in the repository merge after combined local checks;\\\\nit adds no deployment or adad enablement authority.')\\nold='development-workflows 0.5.1. The current adopted successor is 0.6.1 at commit\\\\n`91a47d9fdde8aad214a0ab12742517cce344b709`; use its\\\\ncomplete canonical baseline and qualify its stricter rules with TaxKit\\\\'s\\\\nexisting checks. Earlier dated research retains its original skill version.'\\nnew='development-workflows 0.5.1. Resolve current shared guidance through\\\\n[the latest published plugin lookup](../skills.md) and read the local profiles\\\\nalongside it. The copied 0.6.1 baseline at\\\\n`91a47d9fdde8aad214a0ab12742517cce344b709` remains dated history; it does not\\\\nselect today\\\\'s plugin. The qualified repository enforcement and installed\\\\ndependency graph own co