ts and current docs now corrected and focused checks passing.\",\"prefix_rule\":[\"python3\"],\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":1500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11a78-0d20-79f1-98ee-3fa84f9694e8","create_time":1791445681.4810095}}}
