o its first parent.\\n\\nAuthority: Cooper's direct instruction on 8 October 2026: “Merge everything”. Merge commits preserve the reviewed identities; `[skip ci]` follows Cooper's instruction to run checks locally while Actions credits are exhausted.\\nEOF\\ngh pr create --repo crcorbett/taxkit --base main --head codex/merge-all-20261008 --draft --title 'Combine all reviewed TaxKit work and the Medicare correction [skip ci]' --body-file /private/tmp/taxkit-merge-pr-body.md\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Create the reviewable combined merge PR with the authenticated repository owner after the connector failed with a collaborator error and readback confirmed no PR was created.\",\"prefix_rule\":[\"gh\",\"pr\",\"create\"],\"max_output_tokens\":2000,\"yield_time_ms\":1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11a78-0d20-79f1-98ee-3fa84f9694e8","create_time":1791446016.4027758}}}
