nt path; `vendor/taxkit` is read-only. [Task 1]\n5416:# Task Group: TaxKit release train and Cloudflare/Alchemy docs deployment\n5418:applies_to: cwd=/Users/cooper/Projects/taxkit and /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/*/taxkit; reuse_rule=release, PR, SHA, and provider state are time-sensitive; inspect current checkout before acting.\n5427:- TaxKit, Changesets, version-repo, release:check, npm publication, Oxlint, anti-slop, Alchemy, Doppler, GPT-6 Sol\n5433:- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/3ebe/taxkit, rollout_path=/Users/cooper/.codex/sessions/2026/09/23/rollout-2026-09-23T17-37-41-01a0cd32-ebb7-7b83-b8f7-9a9163ee513f.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-24T04:27:39+00:00, thread_id=01a0cd32-ebb7-7b83-b8f7-9a9163ee513f, hosted Preview/Production plan proof; Production apply remains pending)\n5437:- `@taxkit/infrastructure`, `alchemy.run.ts`, `Cloudflare.Website.Vite(\"DocsWebsite\")`, beta.79, Effect rc.117, `FAIL [doppler-custody] reason=scoped-token`, PR #78, workflow-plan-projection.ts\n5442:- durable TaxKit artifacts must not expose reference repositories or their checkout paths; use them only as private comparative evidence. [Task 1]\n5451:- `bun run version-repo` consumed `.changeset/taxkit-hard-cutover.md`, moved nine private `@taxkit/*` packages to `1.0.0`, and generated changelogs; `bun run release:check`, post-version verification, and packed downstream validation passed. An empty Changeset is not needed when `changeset status --verbose` reports changed packages after consumption. [Task 1]\n5456:- Alchemy beta.79 uses `workersDev: true`; an empty plan emits `Plan: no resources`. Accept that string only for already-absent teardown in `tools/docs-deployment/workflow-plan-projection.ts`; retain beta.64 fixtures as historical. `@taxkit/infrastructure` owns the single stable `Cloudflare.Website.Vite(\"DocsWebsite\")` graph, while root `alchemy.run.ts` composes provider/state/stage. [Task 6]\n5462:- Symptom: audit notes or proposed patches