{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T08:06:52.737Z","ordinal":78140,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac74f1bcf8c87d0b0d8dd4f26e5e86d","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"All nine local checks passed. The fresh SDK package and downstream runs passed, and all 1,712 source files match the saved copy. I’m saving the result, then merging #171.\n"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11a78-0d20-79f1-98ee-3fa84f9694e8","create_time":1791446811.8162856,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac74f1bcf8c87d0b0d8dd4f26e5e86d","turn_id":"01a11a78-0d20-79f1-98ee-3fa84f9694e8","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a11a8d-0841-7e11-8414-0ca526e3eaba","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1842}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T08:07:22.057Z","ordinal":78141,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac74f1d065887d0804d3eed35da847b","status":"completed","call_id":"call_7dc05c2f5d014b489675962079ab88ea","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport json,hashlib,datetime\\np=Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json');r=json.loads(p.read_text());proof=json.loads(Path('/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-passing-evidence.json').read_text())\\nr['status']='passed';r['candidateIdentity']=proof['candidate']\\nr['claim']='The exact combination of all 81 recorded open TaxKit PR heads and preserved main changes passes all nine local release checks before the authorised repository merge tracked by PR #171.'\\nr['observations'].append('The final complete local report at 44a5e236460a74285c3894195184a7865371e92b passed all nine ordered checks once with true zero exits in 1080.48 seconds. Both native app runs passed all 22 cases; isolated workflow tests passed all 34. Packed SDK and strict downstream checks were real cache-miss executions. All 18 exact report-selected log digests were independently read and matched; all 1712 frozen source identities matched before proof-only closeout.')\\nr['observations'].append('Integration draft #171 was created and read back at head 44a5e236460a74285c3894195184a7865371e92b targeting main. The GitHub connector returned a collaborator validation error before creating a PR; a fresh no-existing-PR readback preceded creation with authenticated local repository owner crcorbett. The created PR is attached to this chat. Publication and eventual merge state are owned by that live PR readback, not by local test output.')\\nr['postconditions']=['All 81 recorded original PR heads are ancestors of the qualified integration candidate; the already merged #140/#153 main changes remain ancestors.','All nine combined-source local release checks passed. All 18 selected log digests and all 1712 frozen source identities matched at qualification closeout.','Current docs and task intent preserve the approved shared-plugin migration. T008 remains in_progress, T009 and T010 pending; their statuses, blockers and acceptance conditions are not completed by merging.']\\nfor name in ['taxkit-merge-final-qualified-results.jsonl','taxkit-merge-final-qualified-release-report.log','taxkit-merge-final-qualified-source-freeze.json','taxkit-merge-passing-evidence.json','taxkit-merge-integration-pr-created.json']:\\n f=Path('/private/tmp')/name;r['detailArtifacts'].append({'path':name,'sha256':hashlib.sha256(f.read_bytes()).hexdigest()})\\nfor c in proof['orderedChecks']:\\n for channel in ['stdout','stderr']:\\n  a=c[channel];r['detailArtifacts'].append({'path':a['path'],'sha256':a['sha256'].removeprefix('sha256:')})\\nr['limitations']=['The passed claim is local combined-source qualification. GitHub PR #171 and independent current main/PR readback own the repository merge outcome; no hosted CI success is claimed.','Final closeout changes only this receipt and the active plan to record completed qualification. Focused docs/runbook/path/format/Changeset checks cover those metadata edits; the full report remains bound to the exact qualified semantic source.','Merging does not complete T008/T009 or full T010 acceptance. Collection remains off.']\\nr['observedAt']=datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat();p.write_text(json.dumps(r,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md');s=p.read_text();s+='\\\\n\\\\nCombined-source qualification is complete at\\\\n`44a5e236460a74285c3894195184a7865371e92b`: all nine local release checks\\\\npassed in 1,080.48 seconds. The packed SDK and strict downstream checks ran\\\\nfreshly; both native app runs passed all 22 cases and the isolated workflow\\\\nsuite passed all 34. All 18 selected output digests and all 1,712 frozen source\\\\nidentities matched before this proof-only closeout. The\\\\n[bounded qualification receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json)\\\\nretains the failed attempts, corrections and limits.\\\\n\\\\nThe authorised repository merge is tracked by\\\\n[PR #171](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/171); current GitHub main and\\\\nPR readback own its external result. This closeout records proof only in this\\\\nplan and receipt. It preserves the qualified runtime source and all task\\\\nstatuses, blockers, acceptance and PostHog/metrics deferrals. Full T010 remains\\\\nopen; no package version application, publication or new deployment is made.\\\\n';p.write_text(s)\\nPY\\npython3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\\\"docs\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"check:docs\\\"]],[\\\"runbooks\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"check:runbooks\\\"]],[\\\"paths\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"check:repository-paths\\\"]],[\\\"format\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"format:check\\\"]],[\\\"changeset\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"changeset:status\\\"]],[\\\"diff\\\",[\\\"git\\\",\\\"diff\\\",\\\"--check\\\"]]]' taxkit-merge-metadata-closeout\",\"max_output_tokens\":2600,\"yield_time_ms\":1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11a78-0d20-79f1-98ee-3fa84f9694e8","create_time":1791446813.027703}}}
