,'closedStatusException':'GitHub automatically closed eight empty stacked PRs during the atomic non-forced target-branch updates; they have not been described as individually merged. Every recorded original commit remains in main.','observedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat()}\\nPath('/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-final-outcome.json').write_text(json.dumps(out,indent=2)+'\\\\n');print(out)\\nPY\",\"max_output_tokens\":2000}));\ntext(await tools.clock__curr_time({}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11a78-0d20-79f1-98ee-3fa84f9694e8","create_time":1791447300.470642}}}
