 8 October. Preserve the tested one-project design in draft <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"f2c8f9f4-d24d-40d2-9b7f-d7221f04abbe\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-79-use-one-shared-posthog-project-and-close-rejected-requests-61d4c708ada1\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#169</pull-request> and keep collection off. Browser pageviews, actual project creation, tracking activation and stored-event checks remain unfinished; resume only when Cooper asks. No billing upgrade, credential creation or provider change is authorised by this handover.\\\\n\\\\n<pull-request id=\\\\\\\"397baa65-c16b-498d-acd8-6129b4745683\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-81-record-reviewed-handover-and-analytics-deferrals-cd08825ec160\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#170</pull-request> records this decision in the SPEC, task list and active plan, with the reviewed handover and passing local release/SDK checks. [Exact evidence](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/fc4da30fdc6797ebed905c79823ff5e9508d33ba/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-review-handover.json>). <issue id=\\\\\\\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\\\\\\\" href=\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"DEV-80\\\",\\n    \\\"uuid\\\": \\\"17d02184-45d0-4203-9b86-963399b73dc3\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"Backlog\\\",\\n    \\\"completedAt\\\": null,\\n    \\\"assignee\\\": null,\\n    \\\"assigneeId\\\": null,\\n    \\\"project\\\": \\\"Taxkit\\\",\\n    \\\"projectId\\\": \\\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\\\",\\n    \\\"relations\\\": {\\n      \\\"blocks\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": \\\"DEV-81\\\",\\n          \\\"title\\\": \\\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"blockedBy\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"id\\\": \\\"DEV-75\\\",\\n          \\\"title\\\": \\\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\\\"\\n        },\\n        {