ect':'4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069','health':'onTrack','body':'The prepared TaxKit rebuild and approved Medicare correction are now on main through [#171](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/171). All 81 original PR commits are retained, and no PRs remain open. GitHub records 73 originals merged and automatically closed eight empty PRs. Maintainers can now use the combined checked source; no action is needed from live calculator users because this operation made no new deployment.\\\\n\\\\nAll nine release checks passed locally on Cooper’s Mac, including fresh SDK package/downstream runs and both built Website/API runs with all 22 cases. [Exact qualification and remaining limits](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/710b13691de495e33ca7d85f27df40c9ff0f513b/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json). Hosted CI success is not claimed; checks follow Cooper’s instruction while Actions credits are exhausted.\\\\n\\\\nPostHog and metrics remain postponed. Collection stays off. DEV-79 remains In Progress, DEV-80 and DEV-81 remain Backlog, with their existing acceptance conditions and blockers. Full rebuild acceptance remains open; resume the postponed requirements when Cooper directs. No package versions, publication, billing, credentials, provider state or adad enablement changed.'}\\nPath('/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-linear-proposed-closeout.json').write_text(json.dumps({'DEV-81':args81,'Taxkit project update':project},indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nprint('Prepared exact DEV-81 correction and one native Taxkit project update in /private/tmp/taxkit-merge-linear-proposed-closeout.json')\\nPY\\ngit status --short\\ngit diff --exit-code origin/main HEAD\\ngh pr view 171 --repo crcorbett/taxkit --json state,mergeCommit,body > /private/tmp/taxkit-merge-final-pr-record.json\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"Prepare the reviewable Linear closeout, confirm a clean checkout matching main, and save the final existing PR record while awaiting the connector's required confirmation.\",\"prefix_rule\":[\"gh\"],\"max_output_tokens\":1300,\"yield_time_ms\":1000}));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:74468,chars:\"\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":1000}));\ntext(await tools.clock__curr_time({}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11a78-0d20-79f1-98ee-3fa84f9694e8","create_time":1791447429.4845994}}}
