{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T08:18:26.838Z","ordinal":78298,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a11a97-9f96-71b0-833f-c4196f1bea74","call_id":"call_5a2b0867a4464784aabf308dee822e0b","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__executor_personal__resume\",\"description\":\"Resume a paused execution using the executionId returned by execute.\\nThis connection explicitly allows model-side resume via elicitation_mode=model.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__executor_personal__resume(args: {\\n  // How to respond to the interaction\\n  action: \\\"accept\\\" | \\\"decline\\\" | \\\"cancel\\\";\\n  // Optional JSON-encoded response content for form elicitations\\n  content?: string;\\n  // The execution ID from the paused result\\n  executionId: string;\\n  // How long an accepted approval lasts, when the paused interaction's terms offer a choice: one of interaction.meta.persist. Omit to approve this call only.\\n  persist?: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__executor_personal__skills\",\"description\":\"Documentation for THIS server's own tools. Not a general skill reader: it serves a short, fixed set of how-to docs about using `execute` and artifacts here, and it cannot reach your harness's skills, a SKILL.md on disk, or any user- or project-authored skill. The argument is a name from its own catalog, never a path or an outside skill's id.\\nThese docs hold the long-form guidance that would otherwise bloat another tool's always-loaded description.\\nCall `skills({ name: \\\"execute\\\" })` for the full guide to writing code for the `execute` tool (search the catalog, call tools, emit results, resume paused runs).\\nCall with no name to list the few docs available.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__executor_personal__skills(args: {\\n  // A doc from this server's own catalog, e.g. \\\"execute\\\". Omit to list the catalog.\\n  name?: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"}]"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"fccb61\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000005333,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":46,\"output\":\"{'main': '710b13691de495e33ca7d85f27df40c9ff0f513b', 'PR171Merged': True, 'all81OriginalHeadsContained': True, 'openPRs': 0, 'recordsAccurate': True, 'trackingApprovalPending': True}\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"current_time\":\"2026-10-08 08:18:26 UTC\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11a78-0d20-79f1-98ee-3fa84f9694e8","create_time":1791447506.838261}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
